<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Friday 100,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Friday 100,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Friday's est 100,000, Wk ago 98,00, Yr ago 105,000, and Saturday's 30,000, 15,000 and 23,000 head at interior Iowa-so Minn. Estimates include generally about 65 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts traded steady to $0.50 higher than mid-session Thursday. Trade was slow to moderate for moderate demand and light to moderate offerings. Top $50.00 per cwt.</p>
